Public domain dedication
========================

The zip bomb tools in this repository—`zipbomb`, `ratio`, `Makefile`,
`optimize.R`, and `optimize.out`—were written by David Fifield
<david@bamsoftware.com> and are released into the public domain.
Project home: https://www.bamsoftware.com/hacks/zipbomb/

The accompanying article "A better zip bomb" (see `website/A better zip bomb.md`)
is the author's paper from the USENIX WOOT 2019 workshop, originally published
at https://www.bamsoftware.com/hacks/zipbomb/ . The Chinese translation of the
article is by 北岸冷若冰霜 (zerosun.top,
https://zerosun.top/2019/07/07/A-better-zip-bomb/).

